Attribution obligation
    Apache-2.0 requires that the copyright notice and licence text travel with
    the model. scripts/fetch_models.sh downloads the upstream LICENSE files
    alongside the weights for this reason. Do not remove them.

Models that must NOT be substituted here
    InsightFace / ArcFace weights (including the `buffalo_*` packages, and the
    defaults used by CompreFace and DeepFace) are licensed for NON-COMMERCIAL
    RESEARCH ONLY. Using them in this service would be a licence breach.
    InsightFace directs commercial users to recognition-oss-pack@insightface.ai.

    The permissive licence badge on a repository says nothing about the weights
    it downloads at runtime. Verify the weights, not the repository.

